      "options": {
        "mode": "html",
        "content": "<style>\n/* THEME STRATEGY (rewritten 2026-08-05 after a live-mode bug):\n   Do NOT key off Grafana's `body.theme-dark` class. Grafana serves that class hardcoded\n   in the initial HTML and then swaps themes via CSS-in-JS WITHOUT updating it, so a\n   `body.theme-dark` selector matches permanently and the banner rendered dark inside a\n   light dashboard. It looked correct only under /render, because the image renderer\n   bakes ?theme= into the served page.\n   Instead this panel is theme-AGNOSTIC: transparent background and inherited text\n   colour mean it is automatically whatever Grafana is. Hierarchy comes from opacity,\n   not from hardcoded greys. Accents are duotone mid-tones that clear contrast on both\n   #EEF1F4 and #06080A. prefers-color-scheme then lifts the accent for dark, which is\n   what tracks the operating system's light/dark switch when Grafana's theme pref is \"system\". */\n.praxen-hud{--pa:#2E7D9A;--pg:#4A6B8A;--pok:#2F8F72;--pw:#B0862A;--pc:#A8453F;\n  --pline:rgba(127,127,127,.28);--pglow:none}\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark){\n  .praxen-hud{--pa:#5AB0CE;--pg:#8DA3BA;--pok:#3F8F7E;--pw:#C9A227;--pc:#B85C5C;\n    --pline:rgba(160,170,180,.22);--pglow:0 0 10px rgba(90,176,206,.30)}\n}\n.praxen-hud{font-family:'JetBrains Mono','SF Mono',Menlo,Consolas,monospace;position:relative;box-sizing:border-box;color:inherit;\n  padding:12px 16px 10px 18px;background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--pline);\n  border-left:3px solid var(--pa);border-radius:3px;overflow:hidden}\n.praxen-hud *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.praxen-hud .ph-tick{position:absolute;width:12px;height:12px;opacity:.55;border-color:var(--pa)}\n.praxen-hud .ph-tl{top:0;left:0;border-top:1px solid;border-left:1px solid}\n.praxen-hud .ph-tr{top:0;right:0;border-top:1px solid;border-right:1px solid}\n.praxen-hud .ph-br{bottom:0;right:0;border-bottom:1px solid;border-right:1px solid}\n.praxen-hud .ph-top{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n.praxen-hud .ph-mark{color:var(--pa);font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-shadow:var(--pglow)}\n/* inherited colour + opacity => correct in BOTH themes with no detection */\n.praxen-hud .ph-mark2{font-size:21px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;opacity:.62}\n.praxen-hud .ph-live{color:var(--pok);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2px;\n  border:1px solid var(--pok);border-radius:2px;padding:2px 8px}\n.praxen-hud .ph-sub{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:1.4px;margin-top:4px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.62}\n.praxen-hud .ph-bar{display:flex;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin-top:8px;\n  padding-top:7px;border-top:1px solid var(--pline)}\n.praxen-hud .ph-lbl{font-size:9px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;opacity:.55}\n.praxen-hud .ph-st{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px}\n.praxen-hud .ph-dot{display:inline-block;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%}\n.praxen-hud .ph-pill{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:1px;border:1px solid;border-radius:2px;padding:2px 7px}\n.praxen-hud .ph-div{width:1px;height:13px;background:var(--pline)}\n.praxen-hud a.ph-pill{text-decoration:none}.praxen-hud a.ph-pill:hover{filter:brightness(1.15)}\n</style>\n<div class=\"praxen-hud\">\n  <div class=\"ph-tick ph-tl\"></div><div class=\"ph-tick ph-tr\"></div><div class=\"ph-tick ph-br\"></div>\n  <div class=\"ph-top\"><div><span class=\"ph-mark\">PRAXEN</span><span class=\"ph-mark2\">&nbsp;//&nbsp;ROUTING</span></div></div>\n  <div class=\"ph-sub\">moved 2026-10-30 · every ROUTING panel now lives on the OVERVIEW, in collapsed sections (flow · latency · cost &amp;\n  tier · jev acted · jev observe-only · jev operations · keys &amp; teams · models &amp; local tier)</div>\n  <div class=\"ph-bar\"><span class=\"ph-lbl\">Open</span>\n    <a class=\"ph-pill\" style=\"color:var(--pa);border-color:var(--pa);font-weight:700\" href=\"/d/praxen-command/praxen-overview?${__url_time_range}&${traffic:queryparam}&${key:queryparam}&${model:queryparam}&${team:queryparam}&${interval:queryparam}\">OVERVIEW · same window and filters</a>\n    <a class=\"ph-pill\" style=\"color:var(--pg);border-color:var(--pg)\" href=\"/d/praxen-forensics/praxen-forensics?${__url_time_range}&${traffic:queryparam}&${key:queryparam}&${model:queryparam}&${team:queryparam}&${interval:queryparam}\">FORENSICS</a></div>\n</div>",
